     "type": "markdown",
     "title": "Admin Console",
     "content": "This is the **Boss-only** console for managing **all** access controls.\n- **Worker PINs + RFID** are managed here. - **Parent dashboard** only exposes: Temporary House Access, Guest PIN, Tenant PIN.\nSecurity notes: - Unauthorized edits to sensitive helpers are automatically reverted and logged. - Restricted door actions are enforced at the **script** level (not just UI)."
